cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: 'MATLAB code for "Mathematical Modeling of AA Amyloidosis: Coupling SAA–HDL Binding Dynamics with Path-Dependent Renal Aging"'
abstract: >-
  MATLAB implementation of the model of AA amyloidosis that couples saturable
  SAA–HDL binding to renal filtration of free SAA, lysosomal cleavage to AA
  fragments, Finke–Watzky aggregation, oligomer deposition and fibril
  turnover, and converts the accumulated damage into a renal biological age.
  Includes 22 scripts that reproduce every figure and Table 3 of the
  manuscript, eight supporting routines, and a README that lists the script
  for each figure. Base MATLAB only; no toolboxes required.
type: software
authors:
